/S /H1
/P 114 0 R
/T (The residence is approximately one year old, yet a number of significant issues have already become evident, including early material deterioration, the beginnings of black mould, concerns with moisture and water management, and the reported presence of E. coli in the property's water system. Other construction and safety deficiencies have also been identified that may affect the health, safety, and general wellbeing of the occupants.)
